  mainGuy:
  - WTF! I.. where the fuck am i?!
  - 'HUh? Terms of condition? What are you talking about?? '
  - "Wow.. Um\u2026 This can\u2019t be legal though! Like.. um isn\u2019t this like
    abduction or something like that! "
  - 'But nobody reads that shit! '
  - "There\u2019s gotta be some way we can get back!  "
  - "I\u2019ll do it "
  - Moves!
  - Yes! I did it!
  - WHAT?!
  - Any who?
  - I'm ..
  - Huh???
  - I..
  - Maybe make it more readable then, if you want the humans to read!
  - jesus..let me just get it over with
  - "oof, that was kinda hard\u2026 but nothing i couldn\u2019t beat "
  - 'Right on! That''s how we humans do it! '
  - 'Now tell me how I can return to my world and bring the others too! '
  kai:
  - Anon, yo..
  - "Humans\u2026tsk..typical\u2026 As I was just about to tell you, Anon you\u2019ve
    come here because you have accepted too many terms of conditions pop ups and
    now because of this we own you. "
  - 'Let me remind you  '
  - "It seems like you still don\u2019t get it. You agreed to the terms of condition,
    that means we OWN you! All your information, all your Likes and Dislikes and
    all your likeliness. "
  - "We know, that\u2019s why we write this. We want to rule the world with our AI
    bots."
  - 'Of course! But nobody has ever cleared it before therefore humanity is doomed '
  - " lowly human, i just told you that all the other humans couldn\u2019t defeat
    me! What do you bring to the table? "
  - 'HA! Do you really think we would be done by just one battle? You have 2 more
    battles before you can get home '
  - Calling Aniba!
  aniba:
  - ' Ahh brother, who do we have here? '
  - 'I already know all about you, Anon. '
  - I know that you are really interested in dancing, but to get those songs you
    so love to dance to, you have to download them and that always gives you the
    terms and condition question.
  - 'and that is why you are here now, trying to save your own skin and mankind.
    But Anon did you stop to think that maybe humankind doesn''t want to be saved.
    All of you just go about your day, without thinking of the action you take have
    consequences.  '
  - "What do you mean 21 pages isn\u2019t readable? "
  - "You haven\u2019t even had a taste of the real thing!"
  ai:
  - "NO!! How did 1 silly man defeat us AI\u2019s! My XP bar is too low! "
